  { num: '5', title: 'Track premium adoption as it matures', body: 'Robotic-assisted implant placement and more advanced CAD/CAM chairside systems are already in use at some premium Indian clinics. Treat this as a later-stage investment once the practice is established, not a day-one requirement.' },
